Ambition Lite

Portions of this work were adapted from or generated using source material in:
- Ambition (original robot and T-rex SVG source rigs, original character SVGs,
  sampled animation joint poses, Primeval Trail LDtk geometry and spawn data).
- cc_templates (the predict/investigate/modify pedagogy influenced the lesson
  structure; cc_templates code is not imported at runtime).

Both supplied upstream archives contain the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The complete license text is included in LICENSE. This repository is an
educational adaptation, not a byte-for-byte source port of the Rust game.
Procedurally synthesized WAV tunes and the simplified Python game loop were
written for this repository, not copied from original Ambition soundtrack WAVs.
